<BaseLayout sideBarActiveItemID="home">
  <div class="pb-12 mt-5">
    <div class="text-xl py-1">Hey there 👋</div>
    <div class="text-5xl font-bold">I'm Daria Gorchylina</div>
    <p class="text-xl mt-3 text-base-content/70">Senior Engineering Manager. I lead teams, own architecture, and stay close to the code.</p>
    <p class="text-lg mt-6 leading-relaxed">
      I lead cross-functional engineering teams building cloud-native products across the full stack: from React microfrontends and GraphQL APIs to Go microservices and AWS infrastructure. 
      My work sits at the intersection of architecture, delivery, and people - making sure we build the right things, 
      the right way, without burning the team out in the process.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg mt-4 leading-relaxed">
      I believe you can't make good architectural decisions from one side of the codebase. 
      So I stay close to the full picture: how data flows through a system, how a UI feels in someone's hands,
      and how a team stays motivated shipping both.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg mt-4 leading-relaxed">
      Currently focused on scalable system design, AI-augmented development workflows,
      and building engineering cultures where people genuinely do their best work ⚡️
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8">
      <a
        class="btn"
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dariagorchylina/"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Let's connect!</a
      >
